1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:04,500
I hope you will
accept my heart, my lord.

2
00:00:04,916 --> 00:00:06,583
Lady Elowen, you must be mistaken.

3
00:00:06,583 --> 00:00:08,500
Severin is just a disowned son.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,458
Redmond is the true
heir of House Carter.

5
00:00:13,958 --> 00:00:15,708
You dare question my judgment?

6
00:00:15,708 --> 00:00:18,791
Offending Lord Severin means declaring
war on the entire Morellan family.

7
00:00:18,791 --> 00:00:20,625
He’s nothing but a miner
who digs in the dirt!

8
00:00:20,625 --> 00:00:23,083
I am the rightful heir. Why choose this failure?

9
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:25,708
Who the hell do
you think you are?

10
00:00:26,625 --> 00:00:27,750
You’re not even worthy of breathing

11
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,291
the same air as Lord Severin.

12
00:00:29,291 --> 00:00:32,458
That’s why I
publicly ended the engagement.

13
00:00:32,458 --> 00:00:35,083
He must have used
some sorcery to trick you.

14
00:00:35,083 --> 00:00:36,291
He didn’t trick me.

15
00:00:37,041 --> 00:00:38,875
You're the one who couldn't recognize a true

16
00:00:38,875 --> 00:00:40,583
god standing right in front of you.

17
00:00:41,208 --> 00:00:42,041
Impossible.

18
00:00:42,041 --> 00:00:44,125
A failure who spends
his time with lowborn miners,

19
00:00:44,125 --> 00:00:46,125
how could he
 possibly 
be a true god?

20
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:48,583
I see now.

21
00:00:48,583 --> 00:00:50,541
It’s not that you don’t believe it .

22
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,750
You just can't stand it.

23
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:58,750
Lord Severin, please accept my proposal.

24
00:00:59,916 --> 00:01:03,333
I swear on the Morellan
family name that I will

25
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:05,583
be loyal to you for
the rest of my life.

26
00:01:07,375 --> 00:01:10,958
We beg you
to accept, Lord Severin!

27
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:12,875
Mother, what do you think?

28
00:01:14,791 --> 00:01:16,000
Yes!

29
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,041
She’s perfect!

30
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:19,458
Thank you, Mother.

31
00:01:21,208 --> 00:01:23,583
And what is
your answer, my lord?

32
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:24,833
Very well.

33
00:01:25,333 --> 00:01:26,583
Across all of Golantis,

34
00:01:26,583 --> 00:01:28,791
there truly is no
woman more outstanding than you.

35
00:01:30,583 --> 00:01:33,666
Today, I accept your proposal.
